WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Forward heavy connects before the Level 2 activation.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.000
Juri activates held Feng Shui Engine.

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.450
Standing medium kick begins the FSE continuation.

4
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.050
Forward medium punch chains into the next heavy normal.

5
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:04.700
Crouching heavy punch launches Ryu.

6
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.200
Drive Impact hits the airborne Ryu and reduces his Drive gauge.
